@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@token = {{accessToken}}

### Search audit logs
# Query parameters: page, perPage, sort (action|resource|createdAt), sortDir (asc|desc), actorId, resourceId, action, resource, actor (boolean).
GET {{apiUrl}}/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get audit log
# Query parameters: actor (boolean).
GET {{apiUrl}}/audit-logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
